{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"44a374d529cf9f64","type":"text","text":"Dissociation\nEssence: Surrender collapses into disconnection.\nDistortion\n• \tFog\n• \tEmotional diffusion\n• \tLoss of thread\nCollapse\n• \tDisorientation\n• \tFalling out of the cycle\n• \tLosing contact with self or environment\nShadow Expression\nUnmaking becomes disappearance\nDrift becomes a void instead of a softening.n\n\n","x":-195,"y":490,"width":400,"height":350},
		{"id":"ffe68b70135e21c0","type":"text","text":"Gate\nPhase 1 — Gate (Initiation)\nZone: Mistreach\nNode: Gate\nRole: Gate‑Opener\nTriad: Initiation Engine\nBehavior: Curiosity, openness, boundary‑testing\nMovement: Stable → Drift\nFunction: A threshold opens; the cycle begins.\n","x":-195,"y":-1440,"width":400,"height":280},
		{"id":"7c186a3c31d13ee0","type":"text","text":"False Gate\nEssence: Opening collapses into misdirection.\nDistortion\n• \tOver‑opening\n• \tChasing novelty\n• \tBoundary confusion\nCollapse\n• \tStepping through the wrong threshold\n• \tPremature commitment\n• \tMistaking noise for signal\nShadow Expression\nCompulsion to begin without orientation\nGate becomes a trapdoor instead of a doorway.\n","x":-195,"y":-1000,"width":400,"height":360},
		{"id":"b021b029ddc55a0c","type":"text","text":"Signal\nPhase 2 — Signal (Patterning)\nZone: Airswell\nNode: Signal\nRole: Signal‑Keeper\nTriad: Initiation → Rupture\nBehavior: Pattern recognition, momentum, clarity\nMovement: Stable\nFunction: Meaning emerges; direction forms.\n","x":-805,"y":-960,"width":330,"height":280},
		{"id":"f66c4c93f966f622","type":"text","text":"Noise Spiral\nEssence: Pattern collapses into distortion.\nDistortion\n• \tOver‑interpretation\n• \tHyper‑analysis\n• \tConflicting meanings\nCollapse\n• \tSignal overload\n• \tMisreading the environment\n• \tTriggering rupture prematurely\nShadow Expression\nMeaning becomes noise\nSignal becomes static that accelerates the break.","x":-805,"y":-515,"width":330,"height":350},
		{"id":"b11cdea58dc6eb8c","type":"text","text":"Burden\nZone: Stonefield\nNode: Burden\nRole: Burden‑Carrier\nTriad: Continuity Engine\nBehavior: Weight, memory, structure\nMovement: Stable\nFunction: What remains is carried forward.","x":480,"y":-960,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"908b9715ae65ec9b","type":"text","text":"Immobilizing Weight\nEssence: Continuity collapses into paralysis.\nDistortion\n• \tHeaviness\n• \tOver‑responsibility\n• \tDrag\nCollapse\n• \tFreezing\n• \tCollapse under weight\n• \tBecoming immovable\nShadow Expression\nMemory becomes inertia\nBurden becomes a gravitational sink that pulls the system backward.\n","x":480,"y":-350,"width":400,"height":370},
		{"id":"092aaaf799583459","type":"text","text":"Fault\nPhase 3 — Fault (Rupture)\nZone: Emberfall\nNode: Fault\nRole: Fault‑Bearer\nTriad: Rupture Engine\nBehavior: Volatility, escalation, breakpoints\nMovement: Fault\nFunction: The system ruptures; pressure releases.\n\n","x":-805,"y":80,"width":330,"height":260},
		{"id":"420990b7b73c7cc1","type":"text","text":"Destructive Rupture\nEssence: Necessary break collapses into uncontrolled damage.\nDistortion\n• \tEscalation\n• \tOverreaction\n• \tEmotional spikes\nCollapse\n• \tChain‑reaction breaks\n• \tBurnout\n• \tShattering what didn’t need to break\nShadow Expression\nRupture becomes destruction\nFault stops being a release and becomes a weapon.","x":-805,"y":465,"width":330,"height":400},
		{"id":"343fe5c718d58a0a","type":"text","text":"Rigidity\nEssence: Grounding collapses into immobility.\nDistortion\n• \tOver‑control\n• \tDefensive grounding\n• \tEmotional bracing\nCollapse\n• \tInflexibility\n• \tCollapse of stability\n• \tSnapping under pressure\nShadow Expression\nStability becomes stagnation\nAnchor becomes a cage instead of a foundation.\n","x":-195,"y":1360,"width":400,"height":360},
		{"id":"72507fe84fe87c08","type":"text","text":"Anchor\nPhase 5 — Anchor (Grounding)\nZone: Earthbind\nNode: Anchor\nRole: Anchor‑Holder\nTriad: Grounding Engine\nBehavior: Presence, stabilization, gravity\nMovement: Stable\nFunction: Contact returns; the system regains center.","x":-195,"y":980,"width":400,"height":280},
		{"id":"b510baf3e875e471","type":"text","text":"Drift\nPhase 4 — Drift (Dissolution)\nZone: Ethyldeep\nNode: Drift\nRole: Drift‑Walker\nTriad: Dissolution Engine\nBehavior: Fog, surrender, disorientation\nMovement: Drift\nFunction: Structure dissolves; orientation loosens.","x":-195,"y":80,"width":400,"height":260},
		{"id":"e081602558cd339c","type":"text","text":"Return\nPhase 6 — Return (Integration)\nZone: Threshold (outer)\nNode: Return\nRole: Return‑Guide\nTriad: Integration Engine\nBehavior: Renewal, synthesis, re‑entry\nMovement: Stable → Fault\nFunction: The system reassembles; meaning is integrated.","x":480,"y":80,"width":400,"height":270},
		{"id":"6a4f2249c5c7404b","type":"text","text":"Failed Re-entry\nEssence: Integration collapses into fragmentation.\nDistortion\n• \tPartial integration\n• \tLooping\n• \tEmotional whiplash\nCollapse\n• \tRe‑entry shock\n• \tFalling back into Fault or Gate\n• \tLosing coherence\nShadow Expression\nIntegration becomes disintegration\nReturn becomes a false completion that cannot hold.","x":480,"y":460,"width":400,"height":380},
		{"id":"55093efedbf1ce13","x":-195,"y":-340,"width":400,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Dual-Orbit Diagnostic Map"}
	],
